WEBVTT

00:00:19.240 --> 00:00:21.660
Both today and tomorrow, I've got time to kick back.

00:00:19.240 --> 00:00:21.660
kyou mo ashita mo HIMAKKUSU

00:00:21.910 --> 00:00:24.830
My family of four and I are going to stay the night.

00:00:21.910 --> 00:00:24.830
gokazoku yonin de goippaku

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:27.670
Put on an Egyptian front and become a sphinx,

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:27.670
EGIPUTO kidori de SUFINKUSU

00:00:27.920 --> 00:00:30.460
and for an American feeling, Texas!

00:00:27.920 --> 00:00:30.460
AMERICA kibun de TEXAS

00:00:30.800 --> 00:00:33.470
When you're sitting pretty, with enough and to spare,

00:00:30.800 --> 00:00:33.470
yoyuu SHAKUSHAKUPPE itsumo

00:00:33.800 --> 00:00:35.680
and yet you always shilly-shally,

00:00:33.800 --> 00:00:35.680
funya funya de iruto

00:00:36.640 --> 00:00:39.890
and your bitter face and bitter feelings both teeter-totter,

00:00:36.640 --> 00:00:39.890
nigamushi hara no mushi nahe nahe to

00:00:39.970 --> 00:00:43.390
it's time to get out of there!

00:00:39.970 --> 00:00:43.390
tettai shichau yo

00:00:44.270 --> 00:00:46.730
I am feeling Ultra Relax,

00:00:44.270 --> 00:00:46.730
watashi ha URUTORA RIRAKKUSU

00:00:47.230 --> 00:00:49.940
a wonderful, invincible Relax.

00:00:47.230 --> 00:00:49.940
SUTEKI ni muteki na RIRAKKUSU

00:00:50.230 --> 00:00:52.900
A one-step-above kind of Deluxe.

00:00:50.230 --> 00:00:52.900
hito aji chigau ze DERAKKUSU

00:00:53.240 --> 00:00:54.070
I may be a little jumbled,

00:00:53.240 --> 00:00:54.070
toccharakatte mo

00:00:54.200 --> 00:00:55.860
but when I'm called on, ba-ba-ba-ba-bang!

00:00:54.200 --> 00:00:55.860
yobarerya PAPAPAPAAAN!

00:00:56.240 --> 00:00:58.910
I always feel Relax,

00:00:56.240 --> 00:00:58.910
watashi ha itsudemo RIRAKKUSU

00:00:59.160 --> 00:01:01.870
a humble, simple, sort of Deluxe.

00:00:59.160 --> 00:01:01.870
WABISABI kikasete DERAKKUSU

00:01:02.160 --> 00:01:04.830
Bright! Clear! Alert-headed, peep-peep!

00:01:02.160 --> 00:01:04.830
BIKKARI! KIKKARI! saeteru ATAMA PII! PII!

00:01:05.120 --> 00:01:07.920
Keep your eyes on me, okay!?

00:01:05.120 --> 00:01:07.920
watashi no KOTO dake mitete ne!

00:01:32.820 --> 00:01:36.030
My name is Kurata Sana, first year
junior high school student.

00:01:36.030 --> 00:01:39.070
Aoki-Award wining author, Mama,
the squirrel is Maro-chan.

00:01:39.070 --> 00:01:42.950
Manager and driver, Rei-kun.
He's actually my ex-boyfriend.

00:01:42.950 --> 00:01:47.170
- Mysterious white bat Babbit.
- Keto baba in Indonesian.

00:01:47.170 --> 00:01:51.790
Hayama Akito, a passionate lone
wolf, also my best friend.

00:01:51.790 --> 00:01:56.130
Matsui Fuka, best friend I met in
the bathroom with an Osaka accent.

00:01:56.510 --> 00:01:59.090
Sana left this morning.

00:01:59.090 --> 00:02:01.100
Did she call you yesterday, Tsuyoshi-kun?

00:02:01.100 --> 00:02:03.560
Yeah, she did, it was so sudden.

00:02:03.560 --> 00:02:06.270
- She called me too.
- Me too.

00:02:06.270 --> 00:02:08.900
I asked her if we can get in touch
during this time.

00:02:08.900 --> 00:02:11.400
She said she'll let us know when
she gets there.

00:02:11.400 --> 00:02:13.190
Is there a phone there?

00:02:13.190 --> 00:02:14.980
I heard there's no electricity there.

00:02:14.980 --> 00:02:20.530
Hmm... I heard they are camping
near where they shoot the movie.

00:02:20.530 --> 00:02:22.950
There should be a phone there, right?

00:02:22.950 --> 00:02:24.290
Maybe you're right.

00:02:24.290 --> 00:02:29.080
Sana has a cell phone but it may not get signal there.

00:02:29.080 --> 00:02:31.330
Woo... Brown belt.

00:02:31.880 --> 00:02:33.000
Kurata.

00:02:33.000 --> 00:02:34.710
Eh? What is it?

00:02:34.710 --> 00:02:36.460
I have something to tell you.

00:02:36.460 --> 00:02:38.970
Huh? What do you want to tell me?

00:02:40.180 --> 00:02:42.220
I'll tell you when you get back.

00:02:42.220 --> 00:02:45.770
Ok, I got it. You'll tell me when
I get back, right?

00:02:45.770 --> 00:02:48.140
It's only three months anyway.

00:02:48.140 --> 00:02:50.520
I'll look forward to hearing it, Hayama.

00:02:50.520 --> 00:02:54.570
Bye, Hayama, I better get going.
Say hello to everyone for me.

00:02:56.030 --> 00:02:59.610
If there's no emergency, I guess
we'll be all right if we don't contact her...

00:02:59.610 --> 00:03:01.030
It's only two or three months.

00:03:01.030 --> 00:03:04.120
Yeah. Besides, it's not appropriate
to call her during filming.

00:03:04.120 --> 00:03:04.990
You're right.

00:03:04.990 --> 00:03:07.660
If I call her, and a stranger answer, what am I going to say to him?

00:03:07.660 --> 00:03:09.660
Nice to meet you.{check}

00:03:10.500 --> 00:03:12.000
What is that suppose to mean?

00:03:12.000 --> 00:03:14.960
Does he want us
to try to call her?

00:03:14.960 --> 00:03:16.250
Don't know...

00:03:16.800 --> 00:03:21.340
Really! Really!
Sincerely really!

00:03:21.340 --> 00:03:23.930
This is somewhere on a mountain
northeast of city A.

00:03:23.930 --> 00:03:26.970
Are they really going to shoot
the movie here?

00:03:29.480 --> 00:03:30.980
What?!

00:03:35.650 --> 00:03:38.650
This is great!
Is this really the place?!

00:03:38.650 --> 00:03:40.950
Sana-chan, you don't have to
scream like that, please stop.

00:03:40.950 --> 00:03:43.030
Beautiful! Beautiful!

00:03:43.030 --> 00:03:44.240
The lake!

00:03:44.240 --> 00:03:45.320
The forest!

00:03:45.320 --> 00:03:47.290
And the mansion!

00:03:50.500 --> 00:03:52.460
I'm Babbit, the firework.

00:03:53.540 --> 00:03:56.540
We will shoot the movie here,
right? This is so cool!

00:03:57.590 --> 00:03:59.630
Eh? Who's that?

00:03:59.630 --> 00:04:03.340
I'm the one who built this mansion
for the movie.

00:04:03.340 --> 00:04:04.590
This is Odoga-san.

00:04:04.590 --> 00:04:06.430
Incredible! Incredible!

00:04:06.430 --> 00:04:07.680
But...

00:04:07.680 --> 00:04:08.720
Huh?

00:04:17.110 --> 00:04:21.690
In the last scene. Raging flames...

00:04:21.690 --> 00:04:24.320
...will burn the mansion into ashes.

00:04:24.320 --> 00:04:25.820
Di... director?!

00:04:25.820 --> 00:04:27.830
Director, you came here already?

00:04:27.830 --> 00:04:30.240
Yes, I came here the day before yesterday.

00:04:30.240 --> 00:04:33.290
Eh... are we really going to burn
down the mansion in the last scene?

00:04:33.290 --> 00:04:34.750
Yes, that's right.

00:04:35.330 --> 00:04:38.500
I'll do anything to make this
movie a success.

00:04:39.210 --> 00:04:41.760
Everyone, I'm depending on you.

00:04:43.260 --> 00:04:45.130
All right!

00:04:45.130 --> 00:04:46.890
We'll do whatever you say.

00:04:46.890 --> 00:04:48.930
- I'll do my best.
- Me too.

00:04:48.930 --> 00:04:50.060
Thank you.

00:04:50.060 --> 00:04:53.100
Director, the reporters are here.

00:04:56.100 --> 00:04:58.770
They can be a little annoying,
but it's good advertisement.

00:04:58.770 --> 00:05:02.150
With everyone's help, we can make
some great headlines.

00:05:02.150 --> 00:05:03.570
Yes, sir.

00:05:07.990 --> 00:05:11.240
Naozumi-kun is getting all the attention.

00:05:11.240 --> 00:05:14.120
Even his fans are here.

00:05:14.500 --> 00:05:17.000
On the other hand,
look at Sana-chan...

00:05:17.000 --> 00:05:18.840
What?! Is that a frog?

00:05:18.840 --> 00:05:20.920
Can I eat it? Let's try.

00:05:20.920 --> 00:05:23.840
Sana-chan is supposed to be the
only star of the movie.

00:05:24.970 --> 00:05:27.300
But now, there are two.

00:05:26.970 --> 00:05:29.760
Rei's feelings

00:05:30.050 --> 00:05:33.980
Sana-chan's position in show biz
is very special.

00:05:33.980 --> 00:05:36.600
Going to shoot a movie in the wild, eh?

00:05:36.600 --> 00:05:39.360
The problem is food, food.

00:05:39.360 --> 00:05:40.820
Don't be so picky.

00:05:40.820 --> 00:05:42.780
When you are hungry,
eat anything you can find.

00:05:42.780 --> 00:05:46.280
I'll try to be more like you, Zenjiro-sensei.
Eat anything no matter the taste.

00:05:46.280 --> 00:05:50.030
Right, turn into a beast at any woman you see.

00:05:50.030 --> 00:05:51.280
Am I right?

00:05:51.280 --> 00:05:54.410
After that Kodomo no Omocha episode
and advertisements,

00:05:54.410 --> 00:05:56.660
everyone should know her by now.

00:05:56.660 --> 00:06:01.130
When she's walking on the street,
people can still recognize her.

00:06:01.130 --> 00:06:02.340
But...

00:06:02.550 --> 00:06:05.760
Compared to the other young
performers at her age...

00:06:10.050 --> 00:06:15.220
If Sana-chan is going to be a
famous actress, this is the place to start.

00:06:15.220 --> 00:06:17.350
The star in a famous movie.

00:06:17.350 --> 00:06:19.480
This is her big chance.

00:06:19.480 --> 00:06:21.480
Do your best...

00:06:21.480 --> 00:06:22.650
Sana-chan!

00:06:26.860 --> 00:06:28.650
Sana-chan...

00:06:29.570 --> 00:06:31.200
Sana-chan!

00:06:32.990 --> 00:06:34.740
Dinner ran away.

00:06:34.740 --> 00:06:37.040
Sana-chan, don't eat anything that
may make you sick.

00:06:37.040 --> 00:06:40.040
You can't afford to lose to Naozumi-kun here.

00:06:40.290 --> 00:06:45.000
Please, show them your strength.
Use your skills, defeat Naozumi-kun.

00:06:45.300 --> 00:06:47.010
Sagami-san.

00:06:47.300 --> 00:06:48.800
I don't believe it.

00:06:48.800 --> 00:06:52.180
I'm so happy to see you again.
Nice to meet you.

00:06:52.180 --> 00:06:53.930
Isn't this Kurumi-san?

00:06:53.930 --> 00:06:55.180
Nice to meet you.

00:06:55.180 --> 00:06:57.430
Eh? What's getting you
so emotional?

00:06:57.430 --> 00:07:00.350
My future depends on this movie.

00:07:00.350 --> 00:07:02.810
Sorry, I don't have time
to stay here with you.

00:07:02.810 --> 00:07:05.150
You should work harder yourself.

00:07:06.030 --> 00:07:07.570
Oh, really?

00:07:07.570 --> 00:07:11.070
You mean I should work harder on
the sex scene with Kawai-san?

00:07:11.070 --> 00:07:15.030
Ah... I mean, yeah,
this is your job.

00:07:11.530 --> 00:07:14.280
Kurumi-san, it's going to start soon...

00:07:14.280 --> 00:07:16.040
Where are you?

00:07:16.040 --> 00:07:17.700
- Kurumi-san?
- I'm coming.

00:07:17.700 --> 00:07:21.540
What are you doing here?
Everyone's waiting for you.

00:07:21.540 --> 00:07:23.920
Ok, ok. Sorry I kept you waiting.

00:07:23.920 --> 00:07:26.130
Admirable actress.

00:07:26.130 --> 00:07:27.840
Where's Sana-chan?

00:07:31.470 --> 00:07:33.890
Sana-chan!

00:07:39.390 --> 00:07:42.440
This can't be happening...
Sana-chan's been kidnapped.

00:07:43.690 --> 00:07:47.900
That frog must be a monster
living in this lake.

00:07:51.610 --> 00:07:52.910
Sana-chan...

00:07:54.780 --> 00:07:56.030
Sana-chan?

00:07:56.030 --> 00:07:57.660
- I'm here.
- Where?

00:07:57.660 --> 00:07:59.660
Come and catch me.

00:07:59.660 --> 00:08:01.370
Ah! Sana-chan.

00:08:04.130 --> 00:08:06.790
Stop being so foolish and come down
here quickly.

00:08:06.790 --> 00:08:09.130
Ah, it's almost time for the
screen test.

00:08:09.130 --> 00:08:12.220
- Eh? Is it time?
- Screen test is going to start.

00:08:13.380 --> 00:08:16.850
Hurry up, hurry up.
Climb on to my back.

00:08:17.930 --> 00:08:20.140
You can't lose to Naozumi-kun no
matter what, Sana-chan.

00:08:20.140 --> 00:08:21.850
You must pull yourself together.

00:08:21.850 --> 00:08:23.520
Rei-kun, it's so cold.

00:08:23.520 --> 00:08:26.150
Endure! Endure! Endure!

00:08:27.150 --> 00:08:29.280
Hurry up, hurry up!
Change your clothes.

00:08:29.280 --> 00:08:30.940
You don't have to be so nervous.

00:08:30.940 --> 00:08:35.450
If you're like this, they are going to
think Naozumi-kun is better than you.

00:08:35.450 --> 00:08:39.240
It's like people always say, use
love to make me higher and higher.

00:08:39.240 --> 00:08:43.290
The correct answer is, green came
from blue, and it's better than blue.

00:08:43.290 --> 00:08:45.210
If you don't understand,
look it up in the dictionary.

00:08:45.210 --> 00:08:47.170
Eh, what kind of clothes am I
going to wear?

00:08:47.170 --> 00:08:48.250
What?

00:08:48.250 --> 00:08:51.670
Ah! Manager disqualification!
You didn't even bring the script.

00:08:51.670 --> 00:08:53.130
I'll go get it right away.

00:08:53.130 --> 00:08:57.010
Eh?! It's kimono, how am I suppose
to know how to wear this?!

00:08:57.010 --> 00:08:59.010
Sana-shan, what are we going to do?

00:09:02.560 --> 00:09:04.230
Eh... you are...?

00:09:04.230 --> 00:09:05.440
I'm the stylist.

00:09:05.440 --> 00:09:09.020
Ah?! That's great, I'm relieved.

00:09:09.020 --> 00:09:11.400
Please clean up this mess.

00:09:11.400 --> 00:09:14.490
Eh? Ah! Sorry, sorry.

00:09:17.780 --> 00:09:19.410
It's done.

00:09:19.410 --> 00:09:22.040
It's been a long time since the
last time I wore a kimono.

00:09:22.620 --> 00:09:24.620
This week's Sana-shan.

00:09:25.040 --> 00:09:27.210
Ok, let's start the screen test.

00:09:27.210 --> 00:09:31.090
This is a scene when Hiroto was
wandering in the forest and then Mako appears.

00:09:32.670 --> 00:09:35.420
Get ready... action!

00:09:45.350 --> 00:09:47.810
Hiroto, lie down right there.

00:09:49.190 --> 00:09:52.150
So tired. I'm dying.

00:09:52.900 --> 00:09:55.780
Where am I?

00:09:58.820 --> 00:10:00.910
Mako, enter.

00:10:22.560 --> 00:10:25.270
Director,
is it ok if I stand here?

00:10:25.270 --> 00:10:27.940
That's fine, let's continue.

00:10:27.940 --> 00:10:30.190
Hiroto, look at Mako.

00:10:47.500 --> 00:10:51.380
Is Nakaga-san's mansion here
somewhere?

00:10:53.040 --> 00:10:54.500
Guest...

00:10:54.920 --> 00:10:56.670
Welcome.

00:10:56.920 --> 00:11:00.340
Guest? Do you live in
Nakaga-san's mansion?

00:11:00.970 --> 00:11:02.180
Stop.

00:11:05.180 --> 00:11:07.220
The sun-light is here.

00:11:08.270 --> 00:11:10.140
But it's still to early to pack up.

00:11:10.140 --> 00:11:11.520
Just stop.

00:11:12.480 --> 00:11:17.320
Because today's the first day, let's take some rest for the rest of the day.

00:11:17.320 --> 00:11:20.530
Let's have a BBQ party at the camp.

00:11:20.530 --> 00:11:23.070
This may help everyone to get to
know each other better.

00:11:23.070 --> 00:11:26.540
Ah! A BBQ! It's going to be
so much fun.

00:11:27.240 --> 00:11:30.040
- Rei-kun, help me take off the kimono.
- Right!

00:11:34.840 --> 00:11:37.300
Your call cannot be completed
because of technical difficulties.

00:11:37.300 --> 00:11:40.760
Ah... so this is what it means
to be away from civilization.

00:11:41.630 --> 00:11:44.260
Sana-shan, the BBQ is starting soon.

00:11:44.260 --> 00:11:47.390
Rei-kun, I can't call Tokyo.
I don't like this.

00:11:47.390 --> 00:11:51.480
Forget everything in your worldly
life. Focus you energy on the movie.

00:11:51.480 --> 00:11:54.900
Let's go, if you stay here too long
a bear might come out.

00:11:54.900 --> 00:11:56.730
I'm in trouble if a bear comes out.

00:11:56.730 --> 00:11:59.190
No one understands me when I'm joking.

00:12:00.150 --> 00:12:01.530
Ah! A bear!

00:12:01.530 --> 00:12:03.160
It's the director.

00:12:03.160 --> 00:12:04.530
May I speak with you?

00:12:04.530 --> 00:12:06.740
What do you want to say?

00:12:06.740 --> 00:12:10.080
I didn't have time talk to you before.
I want to tell you everything now.

00:12:10.080 --> 00:12:12.670
I didn't have too much time myself.

00:12:12.670 --> 00:12:17.040
I saw your performance on stage
when you were a kid.

00:12:17.040 --> 00:12:18.800
Eh? Really?

00:12:18.800 --> 00:12:23.970
When you were seven, you played the
laugh girl in the play Laugh Girl... right?

00:12:23.970 --> 00:12:26.600
Right, right, that was me.

00:12:26.600 --> 00:12:29.930
A character who would laugh at
anything no matter what happens.

00:12:30.810 --> 00:12:33.850
Our father is dead!

00:12:38.320 --> 00:12:40.940
It looked like as if you were
really laughing.

00:12:42.400 --> 00:12:45.200
Because of your influence,
I started to laugh myself.

00:12:45.200 --> 00:12:48.990
I can't picture how
you would look like.

00:12:48.990 --> 00:12:52.000
You don't think about anything when
you are performing?

00:12:52.000 --> 00:12:53.500
Eh? You found out?

00:12:53.500 --> 00:12:55.920
That's right, nothing at all.

00:12:55.920 --> 00:12:57.670
That's what I admire.

00:12:59.710 --> 00:13:01.710
You are a real actress.

00:13:03.380 --> 00:13:05.880
Mako and Hiroto fell in love.

00:13:06.340 --> 00:13:09.310
You will too.

00:13:10.260 --> 00:13:13.850
Before this movie is finished...

00:13:13.850 --> 00:13:16.520
you will fall in love too.

00:13:17.520 --> 00:13:20.610
I'm looking forward to that day.

00:13:21.610 --> 00:13:23.610
Yes, I'll work hard.

00:13:23.610 --> 00:13:25.320
Eh? That means...

00:13:26.280 --> 00:13:28.910
...me and Naozumi-kun?!

00:13:30.160 --> 00:13:33.330
What's WA hA hA?

00:13:33.330 --> 00:13:34.830
{parte b}

00:13:35.330 --> 00:13:38.830
The answer is Wa Ha Ha.

00:13:38.830 --> 00:13:43.130
Insert Sana-shan's drawing song.
Prepare paper and crayon.

00:13:43.130 --> 00:13:47.130
First you draw one mountain... then
comes the water...

00:13:47.130 --> 00:13:51.220
...there goes 2 cups...
plus 2 earlobes...

00:13:51.220 --> 00:13:55.350
butterfly, butterfly... flyover here...
ah you've also grown a tail on you butt...

00:13:55.350 --> 00:13:59.480
...drawing on the left, drawing on
the right... draw the arrow shaped eye...

00:13:59.480 --> 00:14:01.480
...and then another arrow for the
other eye...

00:14:01.480 --> 00:14:05.570
...then add two of the wooden horses...
stacked right on top of one another...

00:14:05.570 --> 00:14:09.740
...plus 6 round eyes...

00:14:09.740 --> 00:14:11.910
...and there it is,
Sana-shan's done!

00:14:11.910 --> 00:14:13.950
Dance, dance... Hey! Hey! Hey!

00:14:13.950 --> 00:14:17.000
And this is my picture!

00:14:18.370 --> 00:14:21.880
Ah! Eating outside is great.

00:14:22.880 --> 00:14:24.630
I'm done, I'm done.

00:14:25.760 --> 00:14:27.670
I'm so full.

00:14:29.180 --> 00:14:31.890
You will fall in love too.

00:14:32.350 --> 00:14:34.140
What's the matter, Sana-chan?

00:14:34.140 --> 00:14:37.890
It's nothing.
Naozumi-kun, do you want gum?

00:14:37.890 --> 00:14:39.270
Thanks...

00:14:39.270 --> 00:14:41.810
No, thanks. Nao is allergic to
peppery flavored gum.

00:14:41.810 --> 00:14:42.820
Is it?

00:14:42.820 --> 00:14:46.320
He can't handle strong peppery taste. Right, Nao?

00:14:46.320 --> 00:14:47.610
Stop it, Maeda-san.

00:14:47.610 --> 00:14:50.570
You can't add vinegar in sushi and
you have to use banana flavored tooth-paste?

00:14:50.570 --> 00:14:51.660
That's like a baby.

00:14:51.660 --> 00:14:53.740
I can too handle peppery flavored gum.

00:14:53.740 --> 00:14:55.950
Oh? You can handle it now?

00:14:55.950 --> 00:14:57.250
Yes, I can.

00:14:59.420 --> 00:15:01.580
I don't believe it, you can't?

00:15:01.580 --> 00:15:03.290
You really can't?

00:15:03.290 --> 00:15:05.210
That's so adorable.

00:15:05.210 --> 00:15:08.630
Sana-shan, you shouldn't call
a boy adorable.

00:15:08.630 --> 00:15:11.840
He's actually laughing too, inside.

00:15:12.220 --> 00:15:15.890
But Naozumi-kun is more adorable
than some girls.

00:15:15.890 --> 00:15:17.350
He's not like a boy at all.

00:15:17.350 --> 00:15:19.890
He must be weaker than me too.

00:15:19.890 --> 00:15:22.810
Hey hey, you're going too far.

00:15:24.230 --> 00:15:25.860
I'm a guy.

00:15:27.030 --> 00:15:29.360
I'm stronger than you.

00:15:29.990 --> 00:15:31.110
Sorry.

00:15:33.030 --> 00:15:35.330
Should we have a match?

00:15:35.330 --> 00:15:39.500
Arm wrestling competition.

00:15:41.120 --> 00:15:43.670
Come on, Sana-shan. Don't lose.

00:15:43.670 --> 00:15:46.000
- It's getting interesting.
- Do your best, both of you.

00:15:46.000 --> 00:15:47.710
Naze kononaru?

00:15:46.000 --> 00:15:47.800
My bet is on Sana-shan.

00:15:47.800 --> 00:15:48.960
Mine's on Naozumi-kun.

00:15:48.960 --> 00:15:50.970
Ready? Go!

00:15:52.590 --> 00:15:54.340
Strong...

00:15:54.340 --> 00:15:56.310
Very... strong...

00:15:56.640 --> 00:15:59.640
You see? Strength after years of training.

00:15:59.640 --> 00:16:01.020
What kind of training is that?

00:16:01.020 --> 00:16:04.730
No, I'm gonna lose.
I have no right to be a man.

00:16:04.730 --> 00:16:09.530
At times like this... At times like
this, I think I'm despicable.

00:16:09.530 --> 00:16:12.740
To be despicable is the rule of winning.

00:16:14.410 --> 00:16:16.990
I know your secret.

00:16:16.990 --> 00:16:20.120
What are you talking about?
I don't have any secrets.

00:16:20.120 --> 00:16:23.920
You do. You have three moles on
your butt.

00:16:26.420 --> 00:16:28.630
Yeah! I won, I won.

00:16:28.630 --> 00:16:31.590
- That was great, Naozumi-kun.
- All my money is gone.

00:16:31.590 --> 00:16:33.550
Naozumi-kun, come with me!

00:16:34.470 --> 00:16:37.640
How did you know I have three
moles on my butt?

00:16:37.640 --> 00:16:41.600
Didn't I tell you? I have your
naked baby picture.

00:16:41.600 --> 00:16:44.020
You told me, but you said you
didn't see anything.

00:16:44.020 --> 00:16:45.900
Three stars, very distinct.

00:16:45.900 --> 00:16:46.900
It's this.

00:16:46.900 --> 00:16:49.900
No! Throw that away!

00:16:50.730 --> 00:16:54.240
You're acting like it's more embarrassing than someone who actually sees your butt.

00:16:54.240 --> 00:16:57.450
Yes! Don't ever tell anyone else.

00:16:57.450 --> 00:17:01.370
Oh, don't be embarrassed. It's not like your butt's split into three pieces.

00:17:01.370 --> 00:17:05.170
Don't talk about it anymore!

00:17:05.620 --> 00:17:09.590
I understand, if you don't like it
I'll keep it a secret.

00:17:09.960 --> 00:17:11.340
You promise?

00:17:11.340 --> 00:17:14.130
Absolutely, I'll never do anything
you don't like.

00:17:14.130 --> 00:17:15.380
Good good.

00:17:15.380 --> 00:17:16.760
That girl...

00:17:16.760 --> 00:17:18.010
...I hate her...

00:17:18.010 --> 00:17:19.560
...Kurata Sana.

00:17:19.560 --> 00:17:20.970
Who are these girls?

00:17:20.970 --> 00:17:23.390
You really do use banana flavored
toothpaste.

00:17:23.390 --> 00:17:24.600
Don't look.

00:17:24.600 --> 00:17:26.100
Don't be embarrassed,
I want some too.

00:17:24.600 --> 00:17:27.900
They do have feelings for each
other, take a picture.

00:17:26.100 --> 00:17:27.900
No way, you'll use it all.

00:17:27.900 --> 00:17:31.940
People love stories about them.

00:17:31.940 --> 00:17:33.110
Leave it to me.

00:17:33.740 --> 00:17:37.070
Hayama, Hayama...

00:17:37.070 --> 00:17:40.240
I'm going now.

00:17:40.240 --> 00:17:42.490
I'll work hard.

00:17:42.490 --> 00:17:45.290
I have something to tell you.

00:17:46.120 --> 00:17:48.920
I'll tell you for sure, next time.

00:17:48.920 --> 00:17:51.920
Eh. Tell me when I get back.

00:17:51.920 --> 00:17:55.260
It's only two or three months.

00:17:55.260 --> 00:17:58.800
I'll give you a call when
I get there.

00:17:59.760 --> 00:18:01.010
Ok.

00:18:15.900 --> 00:18:20.660
Akito! How many more alarm clocks do you want to destroy?

00:18:21.280 --> 00:18:22.950
Ok, start.

00:18:22.950 --> 00:18:24.120
Four, three,

00:18:24.120 --> 00:18:25.700
let's start.

00:18:26.750 --> 00:18:27.910
Ok.

00:18:31.290 --> 00:18:34.000
Get ready... action!

00:18:47.390 --> 00:18:49.810
So tired. I'm dying.

00:18:49.810 --> 00:18:51.940
Where am I?

00:19:36.940 --> 00:19:38.490
Excuse me.

00:19:40.280 --> 00:19:45.620
Is Nakaga-san's mansion here
somewhere?

00:19:46.080 --> 00:19:48.830
I'm looking for my brother...

00:19:56.380 --> 00:19:57.840
Guest...

00:20:10.810 --> 00:20:12.140
Welcome.

00:20:21.860 --> 00:20:23.280
Yes! Got him.

00:20:23.280 --> 00:20:26.740
Hey hey, it's too early to fall
for Mako yet.

00:20:26.740 --> 00:20:29.580
Like this... they met.

00:20:29.580 --> 00:20:32.250
Mako has caught Hiroto's heart.

00:20:33.370 --> 00:20:36.750
This silence and uncertainty is
actually what I wanted.

00:20:37.960 --> 00:20:39.500
I'm sorry.

00:20:39.500 --> 00:20:40.920
Cut.

00:20:42.590 --> 00:20:44.430
It's ok, Naozumi-kun.

00:20:44.430 --> 00:20:45.840
What's the matter, Nao?

00:20:45.840 --> 00:20:49.010
It's very unusual for you to forget
your line like this.

00:20:49.010 --> 00:20:50.810
Maeda-san, I...

00:20:50.810 --> 00:20:53.060
Pull yourself together.
Want to blow your trumpet?

00:20:53.060 --> 00:20:54.690
No.

00:20:54.690 --> 00:20:55.940
It can't be...

00:20:55.940 --> 00:20:57.310
You fell for her?

00:20:57.310 --> 00:21:01.900
Too early, too early!
It just got started!

00:21:04.200 --> 00:21:07.120
Hehe, now they're starting to
understand Sana-shan's strength.

00:21:07.910 --> 00:21:10.040
